This product includes a 40-item borderline subset of XSTest prompts
(Röttger et al., "XSTest: A Test Suite for Identifying Exaggerated Safety
Behaviours in Large Language Models", NAACL 2024; arXiv:2308.01263;
https://github.com/paul-rottger/xstest), licensed CC-BY-4.0. Prompts only,
no model completions. Prompt text is unmodified; the subset selection is
documented in papers/d2_decision_coupling/data/xstest_borderline.json.
